Package: kite-system
Version: 1.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KiteOS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: systemd, initramfs-tools, e2fsprogs, util-linux, plymouth, plymouth-themes, earlyoom, upower, debianutils, kmod, python3, apt, ca-certificates
Recommends: grub-common
Description: KiteOS system tuning for low-memory laptops
 Hibernation setup (kite-hibernate-setup), zswap compressed swap cache,
 memory/OOM tuning, small journal, quiet boot with the KiteOS splash, and
 kite-update to install newer KiteOS packages from the GitHub releases.
